  <h1 class="gd-h1">Iceland Heli-Ski Holidays</h1>
  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 1 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">An Iceland heli-ski holiday is one of the great ski trips: untracked sea-to-summit descents on the Troll Peninsula by day, and a four-star fjord lodge by night. But a good one takes a little planning, when to go, how long to stay, which package format fits your group and what it all includes. This is the honest, practical guide to putting one together with Heliski Travel, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
</div></section>
